**Strongest hit:** the falsifier commitment in the Rabbit Hole — "If new first-person evidence surfaced showing harmony, rather than knowledge, as the felt goal, the verdict here would have to move." Almost no published typing anywhere states the evidence that would change its mind; combined with the fortress-object chain (manikin → notebooks → tower → vault) as a genuine 5-vs-9 discriminator, this is one of the strongest Enneagram treatments in the corpus.

**Highest-priority concern (ENNEAGRAM-C2):** FAQ 1 attributes the Riso–Hudson 9w1 typing to *Personality Types*, but the only confirmed placement — per the evidence packet and my two independent searches this run — is *The Wisdom of the Enneagram*. A named-author, named-book claim in the first FAQ answer is falsifiable by exactly the Enneagram-literate readers this page targets; the one-line fix is switching the title to the confirmed book (or page-checking *Personality Types* before publish). Close behind it: the diagnosis section's third pillar treats Jung's function-stack self-report as Enneagram evidence — a category slip between his typology and the Enneagram that a one-clause repair converts into the stronger felt-goal argument.

